{ rrp_string_length.init - a DSEE derived object of be_com/backend.ins.pas
  (cc.a88k only): rrp_string's lengths.
  Included by dmp.pas after its other inserts.

  No Apollo copy survives; reconstructed from the DOMAIN C 6.9 binary
  cc.a88k: dmp's data +0x110 (32 bytes, set by .rwdi).

  Not known from the original: the declaration's form (its name is the
  file's). }

var
  rrp_string_length: array [rrp$t] of integer := [
    16, 15, 6, 5, 4, 16, 10, 7, 9, 9, 10, 13, 12, 17, 6, 6];
